spr-herdr packages these unmodified or separately maintained components:

- Herdr 0.8.0 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), Apache License 2.0.
  The distributed binary is the official upstream Linux release asset built
  from commit 346411fa21afd297f5ed3b3fa56f9e3fbf7654b7. spr-herdr is not
  affiliated with or endorsed by the Herdr project.
- xterm.js and @xterm/addon-fit (https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js), MIT.
- JetBrainsMono Nerd Font 3.5.0
  (https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts), SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  The bundled WOFF2 files are losslessly compressed from the official regular
  and bold JetBrainsMono Nerd Font release files.
- Starship 1.26.0 (https://github.com/starship/starship), ISC License.
- creack/pty (https://github.com/creack/pty), MIT.
- Bubblewrap (https://github.com/containers/bubblewrap), LGPL-2.0-or-later.
  The Ubuntu package retains its copyright and license metadata in the image.

Bundled dependency license texts are included in LICENSES/. Ubuntu package
license metadata remains under /usr/share/doc in the image. The spr-herdr
integration code is licensed under the repository's MIT LICENSE.
